WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.831 --> 00:00:26.644
Eddy was with his friends.

2
00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:29.040
They were driving in the woods.

3
00:00:33.502 --> 00:00:39.647
"This is fun!" Poppy said.

4
00:00:40.050 --> 00:00:41.750
The road left the woods.

5
00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:50.420
The friends stopped.

6
00:00:52.020 --> 00:00:53.360
They saw piles.

7
00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:03.800
Old wheels sat in one pile.

8
00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:07.000
Another pile had car doors.

9
00:01:08.184 --> 00:01:12.647
Everything was rusty.

10
00:01:13.260 --> 00:01:16.200
"This is a junkyard," Jeb said.

11
00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:18.880
"It's a place for old parts."

12
00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:22.320
"It's creepy," Dipper said.

13
00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:25.940
"It's not creepy," Jeb said.

14
00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:27.980
"Let's look around."

15
00:01:29.260 --> 00:01:31.160
Jeb rolled off.

16
00:01:31.695 --> 00:01:37.583
Eddy, Poppy, and Dipper followed.

17
00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:40.520
They went past some big pipes.

18
00:01:45.630 --> 00:01:48.879
Dipper drove through an oil puddle.

19
00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:51.606
"Yuck," she said.

20
00:01:51.607 --> 00:01:56.595
"Let's leave," Dipper said.

21
00:01:56.596 --> 00:01:59.147
"There might be monsters."

22
00:01:59.530 --> 00:02:02.150
"Don't be silly," Poppy said.

23
00:02:02.413 --> 00:02:05.438
"There aren't monsters," Eddy said.

24
00:02:05.438 --> 00:02:08.831
Brumm, brumm!

25
00:02:09.050 --> 00:02:11.630
Suddenly they heard a loud sound.
